 "text": [
  "Boris in 256 colours (the 1000s), each cut out by its 1-bit AND mask (the same id + 4000; black is cat). The 3000s are the same cat for monochrome screens and the 18000s for 16 colours; neither is used here.",
  "Butterfly: 15000-15402 cut out by 17000-17402. 15201 is truncated in the module and is left out.",
  "1000-1007 walk, 1050 1100 turn to face you, 1150 1200 1600 1850 sit, 1250-1253 preen, 1350-1353 run, 1450 leap, 1650 1651 rear up, 1700 1701 scratch, 1750-1753 crouch and pounce, 1800-1803 spring up after something, 1900 tail, 1950 lie down."
